-- Lesson 3. Remembering things.

please remember name is "Ada"
please remember age is 11

please show name
please show age

-- `remember` introduces a name. `change` updates one that is already there.
please remember score is 0
please change score to 10
please show score

-- Two shortcuts you will use constantly.
please add 5 to score
please take 2 from score
please show score
